    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23005" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭnēnōdābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		2. in-enodo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that cannot be freed from knots</i>, <i>cannot be unravelled</i> (only in the trop. signif.
			class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 276, 15</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>that cannot be
				explained</i>, <i>inexplicable</i>, Att. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 15, 10</span></i> (Fragm. Trag. v.
			75 Rib.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fat. 9, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
